{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/6542fa5f6f3205c433b75432b7acee03.poster.avif?t=1768702388\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/6542fa5f6f3205c433b75432b7acee03.webm?t=1768702388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/6542fa5f6f3205c433b75432b7acee03.mp4?t=1768702388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >105+ magical and unique items to discover and craft.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspect items at the Tome to discover item traits. Transfer traits during crafting to create the ultimate item...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain mastery over items as you practice your craft. Gain strength and gather higher and higher quality items!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/6d07cfd834ee3c180218879e31e7c502.poster.avif?t=1768702388\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/6d07cfd834ee3c180218879e31e7c502.webm?t=1768702388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and unlock various areas as you uncover traces of magic.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and Night Cycle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out your expeditions and travel at the right time to find certain items. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you hear the rumbling in the distance...?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/098d6241b5a7e73b82ffbfdeb2b611b5.avif?t=1768702388\" width=1560 height=453 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a wide range of colorful characters on your journey!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say hey to June who runs the local mart!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious Book Keeper has a steady supply of magical artifacts (but how?).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a bite to eat at the Blue Paw Inn. Mr. Ribbit will keep you company.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cauldry, the self-proclaimed most magical cauldron.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, Lemon, our protagonist! Part of the prestigious Queen's Guard, he helps overlook magical activities in the kingdom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001700?t=1768702388","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/cb04f0b7637ab0adb0a81ef347347b2a72c5b1e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768702388","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/29157765cca96749d798c8230ba766868b16c62c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768702388","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/29157765cca96749d798c8230ba766868b16c62c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768702388","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb