..?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/098d6241b5a7e73b82ffbfdeb2b611b5.avif?t=1768702388\" width=1560 height=453 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a wide range of colorful characters on your journey!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say hey to June who runs the local mart!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious Book Keeper has a steady supply of magical artifacts (but how?).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a bite to eat at the Blue Paw Inn. Mr. Ribbit will keep you company.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cauldry, the self-proclaimed most magical cauldron.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, Lemon, our protagonist! Part of the prestigious Queen's Guard, he helps overlook magical activities in the kingdom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ByePidgeon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/20083ed12b325a93fb9a4bae92ee84a151ec7fb8/header.jpg?t=1768702388","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.st